        "detailed_description": "<h1>Follow us</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitter:@MystriggerMagic</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stunning pixel art tower defense game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of the summoned hero——&quot;Fran&quot;, and embark on an epic and fantastical journey of guardianship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064610/extras/0ebb88d4b90be5c4950ec81b8f5a9cd2.poster.avif?t=1772162529\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064610/extras/0ebb88d4b90be5c4950ec81b8f5a9cd2.webm?t=1772162529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064610/extras/0ebb88d4b90be5c4950ec81b8f5a9cd2.mp4?t=1772162529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Move and Build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fran has the ability to use Wish Power to shrink bulky defense towers into portable forms and rearrange them on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064610/extras/bee59cc936f3f771cffb7bd6d2533ab3.poster.avif?t=1772162529\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064610/extras/bee59cc936f3f771cffb7bd6d2533ab3.webm?t=1772162529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064610/extras/bee59cc936f3f771cffb7bd6d2533ab3.mp4?t=1772162529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various Defense Towers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The five humble Whicken tribe warriors can be empowered and transformed into 15 different advanced Spirit Towers, resurrecting the glory of past battlefields!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064610/extras/10f4aab570abc63d0ac62bff4d19633a.poster.avif?t=1772162529\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064610/extras/10f4aab570abc63d0ac62bff4d19633a.webm?t=1772162529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Various Tower Forms Through Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In the face of diverse threats, new tower forms help you tackle new enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064610/extras/8c785bf767d0f1e374a6f2a936a3f86e.poster.avif?t=1772162529\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064610/extras/8c785bf767d0f1e374a6f2a936a3f86e.webm?t=1772162529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064610/extras/8c785bf767d0f1e374a6f2a936a3f86e.mp4?t=1772162529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight with Pani</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alongside the Whicken tribe's powerful Priestess, Pani. She can transform into various heroic forms and unleash powers capable of turning the tide of battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064610/extras/68e4c07831c81c3beb4932fecc3a2cb4.poster.avif?t=1772162529\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064610/extras/68e4c07831c81c3beb4932fecc3a2cb4.webm?t=1772162529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064610/extras/68e4c07831c81c3beb4932fecc3a2cb4.mp4?t=1772162529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dangerous Creatures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Vortex Island is inhabited by a variety of fantastical creatures. Perhaps some of them can become your allies as well?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064610/extras/da937c9465123399f6f1bbba27ba2b09.poster.avif?t=1772162529\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064610/extras/da937c9465123399f6f1bbba27ba2b09.webm?t=1772162529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064610/extras/da937c9465123399f6f1bbba27ba2b09.mp4?t=1772162529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fantasy journey awaits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>·</strong> Embark on a challenge through 5 themed areas with over 20 levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>·</strong> Face a multitude of menacing enemies, ready to shred your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>·</strong> Thrilling and intense boss battles will pose the greatest obstacles on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>·</strong> Pani, with her 9 different forms, is your most reliable companion in adventure and battle, although she has a temper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>·</strong> Mysterious sculptor Gigi will provide you with dozens of upgrade options to make your team even more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>·</strong> You won't be alone on this continent, as there are many allies ready to lend you a helping hand.</p>",
