ebm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064610/extras/68e4c07831c81c3beb4932fecc3a2cb4.mp4?t=1772162529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dangerous Creatures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Vortex Island is inhabited by a variety of fantastical creatures. Perhaps some of them can become your allies as well?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064610/extras/da937c9465123399f6f1bbba27ba2b09.poster.avif?t=1772162529\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064610/extras/da937c9465123399f6f1bbba27ba2b09.webm?t=1772162529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064610/extras/da937c9465123399f6f1bbba27ba2b09.mp4?t=1772162529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fantasy journey awaits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>·</strong> Embark on a challenge through 5 themed areas with over 20 levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>·</strong> Face a multitude of menacing enemies, ready to shred your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>·</strong> Thrilling and intense boss battles will pose the greatest obstacles on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>·</strong> Pani, with her 9 different forms, is your most reliable companion in adventure and battle, although she has a temper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>·</strong> Mysterious sculptor Gigi will provide you with dozens of upgrade options to make your team even more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>·</strong> You won't be alone on this continent, as there are many allies ready to lend you a helping hand.</p>",
